#: ../../src/stream.rst:5
msgid ":c:type:`uv_stream_t` --- Stream handle"
msgstr ":c:type:`uv_stream_t` —— Stream 句柄"

#: ../../src/stream.rst:7
msgid ""
"Stream handles provide an abstraction of a duplex communication channel. "
":c:type:`uv_stream_t` is an abstract type, libuv provides 3 stream "
"implementations in the form of :c:type:`uv_tcp_t`, :c:type:`uv_pipe_t` "
"and :c:type:`uv_tty_t`."
msgstr "Stream 句柄为双工通信通道提供了一层抽象。:c:type:`uv_stream_t` 是一个抽象类型，libuv 以 :c:type:`uv_tcp_t`、:c:type:`uv_pipe_t` 和 :c:type:`uv_tty_t` 的形式提供了 3 种流的实现。"

#: ../../src/stream.rst:13
msgid "Data types"
msgstr "数据类型"

#: ../../src/stream.rst:17
msgid "Stream handle type."
msgstr "Stream 句柄类型。"

#: ../../src/stream.rst:21
msgid "Connect request type."
msgstr "连接请求类型。"

#: ../../src/stream.rst:25
msgid "Shutdown request type."
msgstr "关闭请求类型。"

#: ../../src/stream.rst:29
msgid ""
"Write request type. Careful attention must be paid when reusing objects "
"of this type. When a stream is in non-blocking mode, write requests sent "
"with ``uv_write`` will be queued. Reusing objects at this point is "
"undefined behaviour. It is safe to reuse the ``uv_write_t`` object only "
"after the callback passed to ``uv_write`` is fired."
msgstr "写入请求类型。复用此类型的对象时必须格外小心。当流处于非阻塞模式时，通过 ``uv_write`` 发送的写入请求会被加入队列。此时复用对象属于未定义行为。复用 ``uv_write_t`` 对象只有在传给 ``uv_write`` 的回调被触发之后才是安全的。"

#: ../../src/stream.rst:37
msgid "Callback called when data was read on a stream."
msgstr "在流上读取到数据时调用的回调。"

#: ../../src/stream.rst:39
msgid ""
"`nread` is > 0 if there is data available or < 0 on error. When we've "
"reached EOF, `nread` will be set to ``UV_EOF``. When `nread` < 0, the "
"`buf` parameter might not point to a valid buffer; in that case `buf.len`"
" and `buf.base` are both set to 0."
msgstr "若有数据可用则 `nread` > 0，出错时则 < 0。当到达 EOF 时，`nread` 会被设为 ``UV_EOF``。当 `nread` < 0 时，`buf` 参数可能不指向有效的缓冲区；此时 `buf.len` 和 `buf.base` 都会被置为 0。"

#: ../../src/stream.rst:45
msgid ""
"`nread` might be 0, which does *not* indicate an error or EOF. This is "
"equivalent to ``EAGAIN`` or ``EWOULDBLOCK`` under ``read(2)``."
msgstr "`nread` 可能为 0，这 *并不* 表示出现错误或 EOF。这等价于 ``EAGAIN`` 或 ``EWOULDBLOCK`` 在 ``read(2)`` 下的情形。"

#: ../../src/stream.rst:48
msgid ""
"The callee is responsible for stopping/closing the stream when an error "
"happens by calling :c:func:`uv_read_stop` or :c:func:`uv_close`. Trying "
"to read from the stream again is undefined."
msgstr "发生错误时，被调用方负责调用 :c:func:`uv_read_stop` 或 :c:func:`uv_close` 来停止/关闭流。再次尝试从该流读取数据是未定义的。"

#: ../../src/stream.rst:52
msgid ""
"The callee is responsible for freeing the buffer, libuv does not reuse "
"it. The buffer may be a null buffer (where `buf->base` == NULL and "
"`buf->len` == 0) on error."
msgstr "被调用方负责释放缓冲区，libuv 不会复用它。出错时缓冲区可能是 null 缓冲区（即 `buf->base` == NULL 且 `buf->len` == 0）。"

#: ../../src/stream.rst:58
msgid ""
"Callback called after data was written on a stream. `status` will be 0 in"
" case of success, < 0 otherwise."
msgstr "在流上写入数据后调用的回调。`status` 成功时为 0，否则 < 0。"

#: ../../src/stream.rst:63
msgid ""
"Callback called after a connection started by :c:func:`uv_connect` is "
"done. `status` will be 0 in case of success, < 0 otherwise."
msgstr "由 :c:func:`uv_connect` 发起的连接完成后调用的回调。`status` 成功时为 0，否则 < 0。"

#: ../../src/stream.rst:68
msgid ""
"Callback called after a shutdown request has been completed. `status` "
"will be 0 in case of success, < 0 otherwise."
msgstr "关闭请求完成后调用的回调。`status` 成功时为 0，否则 < 0。"

#: ../../src/stream.rst:73
msgid ""
"Callback called when a stream server has received an incoming connection."
" The user can accept the connection by calling :c:func:`uv_accept`. "
"`status` will be 0 in case of success, < 0 otherwise."
msgstr "流服务器收到传入连接时调用的回调。用户可以通过调用 :c:func:`uv_accept` 来接受该连接。`status` 成功时为 0，否则 < 0。"

#: ../../src/stream.rst:79
msgid "Public members"
msgstr "公开成员"

#: ../../src/stream.rst:83
msgid "Contains the amount of queued bytes waiting to be sent. Readonly."
msgstr "包含等待发送的已排队字节数。只读。"

#: ../../src/stream.rst:87
msgid "Pointer to the stream where this connection request is running."
msgstr "指向运行此连接请求的流的指针。"

#: ../../src/stream.rst:91
msgid "Pointer to the stream where this shutdown request is running."
msgstr "指向运行此关闭请求的流的指针。"

#: ../../src/stream.rst:95
msgid "Pointer to the stream where this write request is running."
msgstr "指向运行此写入请求的流的指针。"

#: ../../src/stream.rst:99
msgid "Pointer to the stream being sent using this write request."
msgstr "指向通过此写入请求发送的流的指针。"

#: ../../src/stream.rst:101
msgid "The :c:type:`uv_handle_t` members also apply."
msgstr ":c:type:`uv_handle_t` 的成员也同样适用。"

#: ../../src/stream.rst:105
msgid "API"
msgstr "API"

#: ../../src/stream.rst:109
msgid ""
"Shutdown the outgoing (write) side of a duplex stream. It waits for "
"pending write requests to complete. The `handle` should refer to a "
"initialized stream. `req` should be an uninitialized shutdown request "
"struct. The `cb` is called after shutdown is complete."
msgstr "关闭双工流的输出（写）端。它会等待尚未完成的写入请求执行完毕。`handle` 应引用一个已初始化的流。`req` 应是一个未初始化的关闭请求结构体。`cb` 会在关闭完成后被调用。"

#: ../../src/stream.rst:116
msgid ""
"Start listening for incoming connections. `backlog` indicates the number "
"of connections the kernel might queue, same as :man:`listen(2)`. When a "
"new incoming connection is received the :c:type:`uv_connection_cb` "
"callback is called."
msgstr "开始监听传入连接。`backlog` 表示内核可能排队的连接数，与 :man:`listen(2)` 相同。当收到新的传入连接时，会调用 :c:type:`uv_connection_cb` 回调。"

#: ../../src/stream.rst:123
msgid ""
"This call is used in conjunction with :c:func:`uv_listen` to accept "
"incoming connections. Call this function after receiving a "
":c:type:`uv_connection_cb` to accept the connection. Before calling this "
"function the client handle must be initialized. < 0 return value "
"indicates an error."
msgstr "此调用与 :c:func:`uv_listen` 配合使用，用于接受传入连接。在收到 :c:type:`uv_connection_cb` 之后调用此函数以接受连接。调用此函数前，client 句柄必须已初始化。返回值 < 0 表示出错。"

#: ../../src/stream.rst:128
msgid ""
"When the :c:type:`uv_connection_cb` callback is called it is guaranteed "
"that this function will complete successfully the first time. If you "
"attempt to use it more than once, it may fail. It is suggested to only "
"call this function once per :c:type:`uv_connection_cb` call."
msgstr "当 :c:type:`uv_connection_cb` 回调被调用时，保证此函数第一次会成功完成。若尝试多次使用它，则可能失败。建议每次 :c:type:`uv_connection_cb` 调用只调用一次此函数。"

#: ../../src/stream.rst:134
msgid "`server` and `client` must be handles running on the same loop."
msgstr "`server` 和 `client` 必须是运行在同一个事件循环上的句柄。"

#: ../../src/stream.rst:138
msgid ""
"Read data from an incoming stream. The :c:type:`uv_read_cb` callback will"
" be made several times until there is no more data to read or "
":c:func:`uv_read_stop` is called."
msgstr "从传入流中读取数据。:c:type:`uv_read_cb` 回调会被调用多次，直到没有更多数据可读或调用了 :c:func:`uv_read_stop` 为止。"

#: ../../src/stream.rst:142
msgid ""
":c:func:`uv_read_start` now consistently returns `UV_EALREADY` when "
"called twice, and `UV_EINVAL` when the stream is closing. With older "
"libuv versions, it returns `UV_EALREADY` on Windows but not UNIX, and "
"`UV_EINVAL` on UNIX but not Windows."
msgstr ":c:func:`uv_read_start` 现在在被调用两次时会一致地返回 `UV_EALREADY`，在流正在关闭时返回 `UV_EINVAL`。在较旧的 libuv 版本中，它在 Windows 上返回 `UV_EALREADY` 而 UNIX 上不返回，在 UNIX 上返回 `UV_EINVAL` 而 Windows 上不返回。"

#: ../../src/stream.rst:149
msgid ""
"Stop reading data from the stream. The :c:type:`uv_read_cb` callback will"
" no longer be called."
msgstr "停止从流中读取数据。:c:type:`uv_read_cb` 回调将不再被调用。"

#: ../../src/stream.rst:152
msgid "This function is idempotent and may be safely called on a stopped stream."
msgstr "此函数是幂等的，可以安全地在已停止的流上调用。"

#: ../../src/stream.rst:154
msgid ""
"This function will always succeed; hence, checking its return value is "
"unnecessary. A non-zero return indicates that finishing releasing "
"resources may be pending on the next input event on that TTY on Windows, "
"and does not indicate failure."
msgstr "此函数总是成功；因此，无需检查其返回值。非零返回值表示资源释放的收尾可能要等待 Windows 上该 TTY 的下一个输入事件，并不表示失败。"

#: ../../src/stream.rst:161
msgid "Write data to stream. Buffers are written in order. Example:"
msgstr "向流中写入数据。缓冲区按顺序写入。示例："

#: ../../src/stream.rst:187
msgid ""
"The memory pointed to by the buffers must remain valid until the callback"
" gets called. This also holds for :c:func:`uv_write2`."
msgstr "缓冲区所指向的内存必须保持有效，直到回调被调用为止。:c:func:`uv_write2` 也同样如此。"

#: ../../src/stream.rst:192
msgid ""
"Extended write function for sending handles over a pipe. The pipe must be"
" initialized with `ipc` == 1."
msgstr "通过管道发送句柄的扩展写入函数。该管道必须以 `ipc` == 1 初始化。"

#: ../../src/stream.rst:196
msgid ""
"`send_handle` must be a TCP, pipe and UDP handle on Unix, or a TCP handle"
" on Windows, which is a server or a connection (listening or connected "
"state). Bound sockets or pipes will be assumed to be servers."
msgstr "`send_handle` 在 Unix 上必须是 TCP、pipe 或 UDP 句柄，在 Windows 上必须是 TCP 句柄，且必须是服务器或连接（处于监听或已连接状态）。已绑定的套接字或管道将被视为服务器。"

#: ../../src/stream.rst:202
msgid ""
"Same as :c:func:`uv_write`, but won't queue a write request if it can't "
"be completed immediately."
msgstr "与 :c:func:`uv_write` 相同，但如果写入请求无法立即完成，则不会将其加入队列。"

#: ../../src/stream.rst:205
msgid "Will return either:"
msgstr "将返回以下二者之一："

#: ../../src/stream.rst:207
msgid "> 0: number of bytes written (can be less than the supplied buffer size)."
msgstr "> 0：写入的字节数（可能小于所提供的缓冲区大小）。"

#: ../../src/stream.rst:208
msgid ""
"< 0: negative error code (``UV_EAGAIN`` is returned if no data can be "
"sent immediately)."
msgstr "< 0：负的错误码（若无法立即发送任何数据，则返回 ``UV_EAGAIN``）。"

#: ../../src/stream.rst:213
msgid ""
"Same as :c:func:`uv_try_write` and extended write function for sending "
"handles over a pipe like c:func:`uv_write2`."
msgstr "与 :c:func:`uv_try_write` 相同，也是通过管道发送句柄的扩展写入函数，类似 c:func:`uv_write2`。"

#: ../../src/stream.rst:216
msgid ""
"Try to send a handle is not supported on Windows, where it returns "
"``UV_EAGAIN``."
msgstr "在 Windows 上不支持尝试发送句柄，此时会返回 ``UV_EAGAIN``。"

#: ../../src/stream.rst:223
msgid ""
"Returns the number of bytes written by a write request. Only valid when "
"called from within the write callback (:c:type:`uv_write_cb`)."
msgstr "返回写入请求已写入的字节数。仅在写入回调（:c:type:`uv_write_cb`）内调用时有效。"

#: ../../src/stream.rst:226
msgid ""
"This is primarily useful when a write has been cancelled via "
":c:func:`uv_cancel` and the callback receives ``UV_ECANCELED`` status, to"
" determine how many bytes were actually written before cancellation. Note"
" that cancelled writes may still succeed or fail with other errors if the"
" kernel finished processing the write before the cancellation took "
"effect."
msgstr "这主要用于写入已通过 :c:func:`uv_cancel` 被取消且回调接收到 ``UV_ECANCELED`` 状态的情况，用于确定在取消之前实际写入了多少字节。注意，若内核在取消生效之前已完成对该写入的处理，被取消的写入仍可能成功或因其他错误而失败。"

#: ../../src/stream.rst:237
msgid "Returns 1 if the stream is readable, 0 otherwise."
msgstr "若流可读则返回 1，否则返回 0。"

#: ../../src/stream.rst:241
msgid "Returns 1 if the stream is writable, 0 otherwise."
msgstr "若流可写则返回 1，否则返回 0。"

#: ../../src/stream.rst:245
msgid "Enable or disable blocking mode for a stream."
msgstr "为流启用或禁用阻塞模式。"

#: ../../src/stream.rst:247
msgid ""
"When blocking mode is enabled all writes complete synchronously. The "
"interface remains unchanged otherwise, e.g. completion or failure of the "
"operation will still be reported through a callback which is made "
"asynchronously."
msgstr "启用阻塞模式后，所有写入都会同步完成。除此之外，接口保持不变，例如操作的完成或失败仍将通过异步调用的回调来报告。"

#: ../../src/stream.rst:253
msgid ""
"Relying too much on this API is not recommended. It is likely to change "
"significantly in the future."
msgstr "不建议过度依赖此 API。它在未来很可能发生重大变化。"

#: ../../src/stream.rst:256
msgid ""
"Currently only works on Windows for :c:type:`uv_pipe_t` handles. On UNIX "
"platforms, all :c:type:`uv_stream_t` handles are supported."
msgstr "目前在 Windows 上仅对 :c:type:`uv_pipe_t` 句柄有效。在 UNIX 平台上，所有 :c:type:`uv_stream_t` 句柄均受支持。"

#: ../../src/stream.rst:259
msgid ""
"Also libuv currently makes no ordering guarantee when the blocking mode "
"is changed after write requests have already been submitted. Therefore it"
" is recommended to set the blocking mode immediately after opening or "
"creating the stream."
msgstr "此外，若在写入请求已提交之后才更改阻塞模式，libuv 目前不提供任何顺序保证。因此建议在打开或创建流之后立即设置阻塞模式。"

#: ../../src/stream.rst:264
msgid "UNIX implementation added."
msgstr "新增了 UNIX 实现。"

#: ../../src/stream.rst:268
msgid "Returns `stream->write_queue_size`."
msgstr "返回 `stream->write_queue_size`。"

#: ../../src/stream.rst:272
msgid "The :c:type:`uv_handle_t` API functions also apply."
msgstr ":c:type:`uv_handle_t` 的 API 函数也同样适用。"

